        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 6540 Contemporary Mortise San Diego Handleset with 5041 Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis contemporary handleset is available as a single cylinder, a double cylinder, and a dummy handleset. The ultra sleek design features concealed mounting. Baldwin San Diego Door Entrance Set will fit 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMortise locks have been, and still are, the established norm for Europe and much of the rest of the world. In the early 1960’s Baldwin brought residential mortise locks to America. They ‘founded’ the residential mortise industry and continue to be the leader – so much so that their competitors have bought Baldwin locks for their own homes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: <a href=\"/products/contemporary-ball-knobset-baldwin-5041\"<b>Matching 5041 Ball Knobset</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern 6540 San Diego Door Entrance Handle:\r\n<ul><li>Solid forged brass for maximum strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty steel mortise lock body for a lifetime of trouble-free operation. </li>\r\n<li>Mortise locks have adjustable forged brass lock fronts, protected by armored scalp fronts for ultimate strength and protection against tampering.</li>\r\n<li>Forged brass and steel mechanical.</li>\r\n<li>Locks and strikes fit standard ANSI A115.1 preparation.</li>\r\n<li>Reinforced steel security strike with three inch screws.</li>\r\n<li>Anti friction latch bolt with 3/4” throw.  </li>\r\n<li>1” throw deadbolt has two hardened steel inserts for maximum protection and security.</li>\r\n<li>7mm hub broached on the diamond</li>\r\n<li>Certified by Underwriters Laboratories (UL) for use on fire doors up to three-hour rating.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Limited Warranty</b> on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Contemporary Estates Collection San Diego Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: 5041 Knob</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Length: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Thickness: .093\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Exterior Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Thickness: .093\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Knob Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Interior Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Hub to Turn Piece Length: 2.25\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Hub to Cylinder Length: 3.437\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" or 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset:  2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-6540.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>San Diego Handleset Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-estate_mortise_dimensions.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>Mortise Box Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "San Diego Mortise Handleset, Baldwin 6540",
                "description": "Baldwin 6540 Contemporary San Diego Handleset - This contemporary handleset is available as a single cylinder, a double cylinder, and a dummy handleset. The ultra sleek design features concealed mounting. Baldwin San Diego Door Entrance Set will fit 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch doot thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
                "keywords": "BAL-6540, baldwin 6040 San Diego handlesets, baldwin San Diego door entrance sets, single cylinder handlesets, double cylinder handlesets, emergency egress handlesets,  Bladwin classic Estate Collection Handlesets, contemporary handlesets, modern handlesets, ball knobs,"
